                            "parameters": {
                                "notes": "Texas is franchise tax (margin), not a standard corporate income tax. Depreciation matters only insofar as it is permitted within the margin deduction method (e.g., COGS). State guidance on bonus depreciation interpretation changed in 2025; do not guess beyond official Comptroller guidance for the report year."
                            },
                            "sources": [
